    "message": "Write the chunks one save adds into one pack file\n\nA v3 checkpoint manifest records where each chunk is in a pack. Chunks of\nearlier saves are referred to where they are, and v1/v2 archives with one\nfile per chunk stay readable. Checkpoint v1 contents and hashes are unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
