    "message": "Remember every chunk a writer packed and list each pack name once\n\nA chunk that left one save and came back in a later one was written again.\nThe writer's encoder now keeps the locations of all its saves, and manifests\nstore locations as a pack-name table plus per-chunk indexes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
